WEBVTT

02:41.271 --> 02:44.482
NAN: The little lord's
been dreaming again.

02:47.402 --> 02:49.404
(GROWLING)

02:51.322 --> 02:54.534
- We have visitors.
- I don't want to see anyone.

02:54.659 --> 02:57.203
Really?
If I was cooped up all day

02:57.328 --> 03:00.331
with no one but this old bat
for company, I'd go mad.
